From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Amaan Qureshi <git@amaanq.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 22:48:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] toolbar: keep omnibox surfaces at the bottom

Bottom placement should persist while editing and on the NTP. The NTP
should mirror its content and controls around the field.
